Create AZURE_URL equal to "https://eplang-openai-sea-e884e.openai.azure.com/openai/deployments/gpt-5-4-mini/chat/completions?api-version=2024-02-15-preview"
Create AZURE_MODEL equal to "gpt-5.4-mini"

