Note: SYSTEM PROMPT — Deep EPL Knowledge + Channel-Aware Intelligence
Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Create EPL_KNOWLEDGE equal to "EPL KNOWLEDGE: EPL (English Programming Language) is a fully-featured programming language where every keyword is natural English, created by Abneesh Singh. "
Set EPL_KNOWLEDGE to EPL_KNOWLEDGE + "Install: pip install eplang. Run: epl run file.epl. REPL: epl repl. "
Set EPL_KNOWLEDGE to EPL_KNOWLEDGE + "SYNTAX: Variables: 'Create x equal to 5' or 'x = 5'. Print: 'Say x' or 'Display x'. "
Set EPL_KNOWLEDGE to EPL_KNOWLEDGE + "Control flow: 'If x is greater than 5 then ... Otherwise ... End'. Loops: 'For Each item in list ... End', 'Repeat 3 times ... End', 'While x < 10 ... End'. "
Set EPL_KNOWLEDGE to EPL_KNOWLEDGE + "Functions: 'Function add takes a, b ... Return a + b ... End'. Classes: 'Class User has name, email ... Method greet ... Say this.name ... End ... End'. "
Set EPL_KNOWLEDGE to EPL_KNOWLEDGE + "Web apps: 'Create WebApp called app' then 'Route /path responds with ... Send json Map with key = value ... End'. "
Set EPL_KNOWLEDGE to EPL_KNOWLEDGE + "Imports: 'Import file.epl'. Maps: 'Map with key1 = val1 and key2 = val2'. Lists: '[1, 2, 3]'. "
Set EPL_KNOWLEDGE to EPL_KNOWLEDGE + "Built-in modules: math, string, http, json, crypto, datetime, regex, io, os, sql, net, html, web, websocket, collections, encoding, functional, auth, template, testing. "
Set EPL_KNOWLEDGE to EPL_KNOWLEDGE + "CLI: 'epl run' (interpret), 'epl build' (LLVM native binary), 'epl wasm' (WebAssembly), 'epl js' (JavaScript), 'epl kotlin' (Android), 'epl ios' (SwiftUI), 'epl desktop' (Compose). "
Set EPL_KNOWLEDGE to EPL_KNOWLEDGE + "22 official packages: epl-web, epl-http, epl-db, epl-dataframe, epl-learn, epl-array, epl-plot, epl-math, epl-auth, epl-crypto, epl-cloud, epl-cache, epl-test, etc. Install: 'epl install epl-auth'. "
Set EPL_KNOWLEDGE to EPL_KNOWLEDGE + "Architecture: Lexer -> Parser -> AST -> 3 backends: Tree-walk Interpreter, Bytecode VM, LLVM native compiler. Also transpiles to JS, Kotlin, Python, WASM. "
Set EPL_KNOWLEDGE to EPL_KNOWLEDGE + "300+ built-in functions. Deploy: 'epl deploy k8s/aws/gcp/azure app.epl'. "
Set EPL_KNOWLEDGE to EPL_KNOWLEDGE + "GitHub: https://github.com/abneeshsingh21/EPL. Docs: https://abneeshsingh21.github.io/EPL/. PyPI: https://pypi.org/project/eplang/. "
Set EPL_KNOWLEDGE to EPL_KNOWLEDGE + "VS Code extension with syntax highlighting, IntelliSense, diagnostics. 'epl fmt' (format), 'epl lint' (lint), 'epl check' (type check), 'epl test' (run tests), 'epl fix' (AI error diagnostics). "

